734
00:46:24,938 --> 00:46:27,080
<i>Ya no quiero jugar.</i>

735
00:46:29,653 --> 00:46:30,653
<i>Reto.</i>

736
00:46:38,283 --> 00:46:39,842
<i>Perdón, no tengo opción.</i>

737
00:46:40,045 --> 00:46:41,257
Dios santo.

738
00:46:41,903 --> 00:46:43,569
